<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Two real estate stocks started.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Two real estate stocks started.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-08-04</dateline>
<text>
<p>Prudential Securities said analyst Louis Taylor initiated coverage of Equity Office Properties Trust and Boston Properties Inc with buy ratings.</p>
<p>-- Equity Office was off 7/16 to 29-1/16 and Boston Properties eased 3/8 to 27-1/2.</p>
